+/* romdev: the ACTIVE 64-entry PPU palette as RGB triples. `palo` selects
+ * between the standard NTSC table and the VS System's rp2c03/rp2c04 variants
+ * (and a game- or user-supplied palette), so a reconstruction that bakes in the
+ * standard table renders every VS cart in the wrong colours -- VS Baseball came
